  "description": "**Original Webtoon:**  \n[MComics](https://www.mcomics.co.kr/webtoonComic/7978), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/1020006453), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/mirror_rk), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=5837107), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000056250), [BookCube](https://www.bookcube.com/toon/detail.asp?webtoon_num=230306), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/forest_reflection)\n\n**Official Translations:**    \n[Japanese](https://www.amazon.co.jp/-/en/dp/B0BT7JDC57/) \n\nWhile Naru Kang, who runs a private ballet company, is struggling to find a solution to the financial crisis, she recruits rising star Seb Strasberg as a guest dancer for the theater company's regular performance, 'Romeo and Juliet'. However, Naru's fiancé and prima ballerina Jang Hye-joo flaunts an affair with Seb. Meanwhile, pianist Song Se-ra, who suffers from stage fright, joins the troupe as a temporary worker... …",
